### 1. API Health Check & Landing Page
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create a New Task (POST /api/tasks)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete CSE 230 Week 7 Assignment Report",
  "description": "Write 5-6 page APA 7th Edition project report for Node.js REST API server",
  "isCompleted": false,
  "dueDate": "2026-08-20T23:59:59.000Z"
}

### 3. Create Task Validation Error Test (Empty Title -> 400 Bad Request)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Test empty title validation error"
}

### 4. Read All Tasks (GET /api/tasks)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### 5. Read Filtered Tasks (GET /api/tasks?completed=true)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/tasks?completed=true
Accept: application/json

### 6. Read Individual Task (GET /api/tasks/:id)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/tasks/66b8d4e92a1b3c4d5e6f7a8b
Accept: application/json

### 7. Update Task Status (PUT / PATCH /api/tasks/:id)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/tasks/66b8d4e92a1b3c4d5e6f7a8b
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": true,
  "title": "Setup Node.js Express REST API Architecture"
}

### 8. Delete Task (DELETE /api/tasks/:id)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/tasks/66b8d4e92a1b3c4d5e6f7a8b
Accept: application/json
